      "evidence": "In the earlier 310-iteration native-SIMD profile, baseline convolveY8ClampedPureGo was 0.29 s cumulative (4.03% of 7.19 s sampled); candidate convolveY8ClampedGoSIMDWithScratch was 0.07 s (1.03% of 6.77 s), with emuEdgeWindow at 0.06 s.",
      "dav1d_relation": "Consistent with the pinned recon/mc source shape above: prepare edge data and then use the normal motion-compensation path. This is explanatory source review, not a claim that the Go implementation is identical."
    },
